      "page": 500,
      "ruku": 435,
      "hizbQuarter": 200,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4490,
      "text": "We gave them clear directions in matters [of religion]. They did not differ except after the knowledge had come to them out of transgression against one another[5]. Indeed, your Lord will judge between them on the Day of Resurrection concerning their differences.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 500,
      "ruku": 435,
      "hizbQuarter": 200,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4491,
      "text": "Then We put you [O Prophet] on a clear way of the religion; so follow it and do not follow the desires of those who have no knowledge.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 500,
      "ruku": 435,
      "hizbQuarter": 200,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4492,
      "text": "They cannot avail you at all against Allah. Indeed, the wrongdoers are protectors of one another, whereas Allah is the Protector of the righteous.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 500,
      "ruku": 435,
      "hizbQuarter": 200,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4493,
      "text": "This [Qur’an] is an insight for people; a guidance and mercy for people who are certain in faith.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
        "numberOfAyahs": 37,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 500,
      "ruku": 435,
      "hizbQuarter": 200,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4494,
      "text": "Do those who commit evil deeds think that We will make them equal to those who believe and do righteous deeds, in this life and after their death? How poorly they judge!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 45,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الجَاثِيَةِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Jaathiya",
        "englishNameTranslation": "Crouching",
